ic-analysis-of-Abandoned-mines-using-rover","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"This project aims to design a LoRa Based Wireless Rover using Arduino Uno & LoRa Module. A DHT Sensor and Gas Sensor to monitor the environment GY-68 sensor along with an Ultrasonic Sensor is used to control the rover. The rover measures the mine environment parameters like Temperature, Humidity, Pressure, Gas Levels & Terrain. These parameters are critical to the design, and comprehensive analysis of these parameters ensures planning and safety of the surface and underground mining activities.","topics":[],"score":225400,"global_rank":135886},{"name":"chaitanyakrishna1248/IoT-based-Tracking-System-for-Emergency-Help","owner":"chaitanyakrishna1248","html_url":"https://github.com/chaitanyakrishna1248/IoT-based-Tracking-System-for-Emergency-Help","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"IoT-based-Tracking-System-for-Emergency-Help","topics":[],"score":225400,"global_rank":135887},{"name":"alexdmiller/cone","owner":"alexdmiller","html_url":"https://github.com/alexdmiller/cone","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":225394,"global_rank":135928},{"name":"bphilipose1/Simple-Shell-Multiprocessing-Pipes","owner":"bphilipose1","html_url":"https://github.com/bphilipose1/Simple-Shell-Multiprocessing-Pipes","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":225393,"global_rank":135989},{"name":"yoyomimi/OS_Linux_FileSystem_Design","owner":"yoyomimi","html_url":"https://github.com/yoyomimi/OS_Linux_FileSystem_Design","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Design my filesystem based on 100M space","topics":[],"score":225390,"global_rank":136029}]